# Local npm cache
#
# Created because this workspace passed `--cache .npm-cache` so installs did not
# depend on a writable global npm cache. Safe to delete; `npm install` recreates
# it if the scripts are run with the same flag.
.npm-cache/

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Locally produced model outputs. A deployment's real artifacts are user work —
# this entry only keeps the default in-repo working directory out of version
# control, which is where `defaultArtifactRoot()` points when nothing overrides it.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing. Unanchored, `artifacts/` matched at every
# depth, including `src/artifacts/` — the artifact contract and the local
# filesystem store — so git silently ignored 28 KB of source that `src/index.ts`
# and `src/hub.ts` import. Every clone of this repository was therefore
# unloadable, and the failure only appeared at install time, as
# "Cannot find module .../src/artifacts/local-store.ts". Keep it anchored.
/artifacts/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
